                    </p>
                    <a href="getting-started">Getting started →</a>
                </div>
                <pre class="bb-code"><span class="k">@@using</span> Bit.Bink

&lt;<span class="k">BinkCanvas</span> Height=<span class="s">"400px"</span> /&gt;</pre>
            </div>
            <div class="bb-walkthrough-row">
                <div class="bb-walkthrough-copy">
                    <span class="bb-step">02</span>
                    <h3>Pick a brush and a tool</h3>
                    <p>
                        <code>Brush</code> decides how ink looks, <code>Tool</code> what pointer input does. Brushes
